            "id": "1291899278260985856",
            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-19/status/1291899278260985856",
            "content": {
              "text": "The other thing I have come to realize is how much of a productivity loss flaky tests can yield in a large SW project: the entire enterprise slows down as engineers fight with CI. Thus, de-flaking tests is one of the most beneficial things a project can invest in.",
