            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-19/status/1291899279208878080",
            "content": {
              "text": "The moral of the story: thorough test coverage is critical for maintaining velocity in a large project, but flaky tests push back on the productivity gain. Invest in your tests, and work on making them flake free!",
