          "post": {
            "id": "1771154492970455357",
            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-25/status/1771154492970455357",
            "content": {
              "text": "\"E2E tests are flaky\"\n\nYep, often true.\n\nBut, E2E tests aren't inherently flaky. They're flaky for a *reason*:\n\n🚩 The UI is buggy.\n🚩 The backend is often down.\n🚩 The DB is constantly changing.\n🚩 The network is slow or unreliable.\n\nE2E tests aren’t flaky. The environment is.\n\nSo find the root cause, and fix it.",
              "media_urls": null,
              "thumbnail_url": null,
              "duration_seconds": null
            },
