              "text": "Raise your hand if you’d love to get rid of slow and flaky tests once and for all. ✋\n\nNow you can.\n\nBuildkite Test Analytics is now out of beta and available free for everyone. Any language, any CI.\n\nLearn more at http://buildkite.com/test-analytics https://t.co/HlUHSaMDao",
